+// UsesResponsePlaceholders reports whether the expression references at
+// least one placeholder that is only populated after an upstream response
+// has been received, such as {http.reverse_proxy.status_code},
+// {http.reverse_proxy.status_text}, {http.reverse_proxy.header.*}, or the
